    <section class="row section" style="background-color:#cec8bc;">
      <div class="row-content buffer clear-after">
        <article class="clear-after">
          <div class="column three" id="room1">
            <figure><img src="img/DSC_2959.jpg" alt="">
              <figcaption>
                  <h3>Exhibition Room 1</h3>
                  <p>Hearn’s life is introduced here, based on the concept of “What he saw, what he heard and what resonated in his heart”.</p>
             </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <!-- column four -->
          <div class="column three" id="room2">
            <figure><img src="img/DSC_2831.jpg" alt="">
              <figcaption>
                  <h3>Exhibition Room 2</h3>
                  <p>Hearn’s achievements and ideas are exhibited here from 8 different perspectives, including “Creole”, “Life” and “Retellings”. In the “Retellings” corner, stories are recited by actor Shiro Sano, with music by guitarist Kyoji Yamamoto (both of whom are from Matsue).</p>
             </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <!-- column four -->
          <div class="column three" id="room3">
            <figure><img src="img/DSC_2843.jpg" alt="">
              <figcaption>
                  <h3>Exhibition Room 3</h3>
                  <p>Various planned exhibitions related to Hearn take place here.</p>
             </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <!-- column four -->
           <div class="column three last" id="stair">
            <figure><img src="img/DSC_1601.jpg" alt="">
              <figcaption>
                  <h3>Stairwell Exhibition</h3>
                  <p>Photos of Hearn’s family and artworks related to Hearn are displayed here.</p>
             </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <!-- column four -->
          <div class="column three" id="library">
            <figure><img src="img/DSC_2743.jpg" alt="">
              <figcaption>
                   <h3>Library</h3>
                  <p>Many of Hearn’s works and related writings are gathered here. A search system for his works and the areas connected to him is also available for use.</p>
             </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <!-- column four -->
           <div class="column three" id="multi">
            <figure><img src="img/DSC_1930.jpg" alt="">
              <figcaption>
                   <h3>Multi Purpose Space</h3>
                  <p>This is an area used to study Hearn, where lectures and workshops take place.</p>
             </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <!-- column four -->
           <div class="column three last" id="entrance">
            <figure><img src="img/DSC_1774.jpg" alt="">
              <figcaption>
                  <h3>Entrance</h3>
                  <p>A museum shop, with Hearn’s books and an array of goods, and a video exhibition corner, introducing Hearn’s life, are located here.</p>
             </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <!-- column four -->
        </article></div>
      <!-- row-content -->
    </section>
